description:
Adopt advanced Bluetooth audio decoding chip to support the connection of all Bluetooth devices;

Support FM radio, you can directly search for radio stations in the listening area;

The tone is soft, clear and dynamic, with distinct levels;

Direct reading of TF card and U disk;

The Bluetooth receiving distance can be as long as 10 meters;

Support LINE IN audio input, provide you with computer speaker function, which can be directly connected to mobile phone / tablet / and TV to wirelessly pair and play music;

There is no connection in Bluetooth mode, it will automatically shut down in half an hour;

Support TWS function;

A variety of flashing modes Symphony LED lights, the lights can flash with the music melody, one-key conversion, the music melody can not only be listened to but also seen.
